,"type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_6","text":"But... I don't think I've seen you before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_7","text":"Are you really as famous in this field as you say you are?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_8","text":"Infamous is more like it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_9","text":"Instructor! You said you'd come here and vouch for me. How can you say that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_10","text":"Ahem. Anyway, while it's a bit embarrassing to say this myself,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_11","text":"people call me the prison brea...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_12","text":"Er... I mean, Escape Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_13","text":"Did I hear you say \"prison\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_14","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_15","text":"Uh... Ignore that. I misspoke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_16","text":"Since I'm a master escape artist, it'd stand to reason that I'd probably be good at prison breaks too, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_17","text":"That's all I meant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_18","text":"After all, just take a look at my outfit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_19","text":"If you want to excel at escaping, you've got to wear tight-fitting clothes.","jump