ll right then, I might not have to hold your hand after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_48","text":"Hehe, you're in for a treat!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_49","text":"All right then, let's practice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_50","text":"You see that second vent from the left?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_51","text":"Yeah. It looks really narrow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_52","text":"I came in here through that vent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_53","text":"Well then, before I teach you anything, how about you show me your skills first?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_54","text":"Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_55","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_55","text":"Tove heads toward the vent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_56","text":"First of all, to navigate through a narrow passage, it's super important to keep your mind in check.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_57","text":"Since there's limited oxygen in constricted spaces,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_58","text":"even Nikkes can end up feeling claustrophobic and panicked if they're not careful.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_59","text":"Very impressive. Your theoretical knowledge is sound.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_powerplant_08_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_powerplant_08_60","text":"She definitely sounds like an expert.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"b